	<bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_global_legend" textFormat="text/plain"><bpmn:text>Decision Mining — Global Settings
Method: Alignment-based (de Leoni &amp; van der Aalst, 2013)
Features: RequestedAmount, ApplicationType, LoanGoal
Leakage-fix: only case-level attributes used (no event data)
Log: BPIC-17 | 31,509 cases | 1,202,267 events
Note: 8 of 13 Petri net decision points removed from this
model (6 tau-only, 2 low replay coverage). 4 remain.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_id6378b446-b44a-4202-ba2a-5bda642c68ca" textFormat="text/plain"><bpmn:text>p_6 — W_Handle leads vs. tau(skip)
N=26,189 | CV Acc=0.602 | Baseline=0.602 | Lift=+0.000
Result: NO IMPROVEMENT
Model always predicts tau(skip). Case attributes
cannot explain which cases get lead handling.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="asc_id6378b446-b44a-4202-ba2a-5bda642c68ca" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="id6378b446-b44a-4202-ba2a-5bda642c68ca" targetRef="ann_id6378b446-b44a-4202-ba2a-5bda642c68ca" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_id9ec42d42-e32c-4b51-9afb-17e5e0f1961a" textFormat="text/plain"><bpmn:text>p_18 — W_Complete application vs. tau(skip)
N=31,502 | CV Acc=0.500 | Baseline=0.501 | Lift=-0.001
Result: NO IMPROVEMENT (near-random, 50/50 split)
Routing likely depends on officer judgment.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="asc_id9ec42d42-e32c-4b51-9afb-17e5e0f1961a" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="id9ec42d42-e32c-4b51-9afb-17e5e0f1961a" targetRef="ann_id9ec42d42-e32c-4b51-9afb-17e5e0f1961a" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_id76f0f3bf-6397-47d7-8776-f9dd20c39683" textFormat="text/plain"><bpmn:text>p_37 — A_Denied vs. O_Accepted
N=7,747 | CV Acc=0.825 | Baseline=0.825 | Lift=+0.000
Result: WEAK (majority-class prediction only)
Tree always predicts O_Accepted (83% of cases).
Denial criteria not captured by case attributes.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="asc_id76f0f3bf-6397-47d7-8776-f9dd20c39683" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="id76f0f3bf-6397-47d7-8776-f9dd20c39683" targetRef="ann_id76f0f3bf-6397-47d7-8776-f9dd20c39683" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_id06f29269-c3e0-4bb4-aa5e-3639eb5de5ff" textFormat="text/plain"><bpmn:text>p_40 — A_Incomplete vs. tau(skip)
N=13,130 | CV Acc=0.733 | Baseline=0.733 | Lift=+0.000
Result: NO IMPROVEMENT
Model always predicts tau(skip) (73.3% majority).
Incompleteness not predictable from case attributes.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="asc_id06f29269-c3e0-4bb4-aa5e-3639eb5de5ff" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="id06f29269-c3e0-4bb4-aa5e-3639eb5de5ff" targetRef="ann_id06f29269-c3e0-4bb4-aa5e-3639eb5de5ff" /></bpmn:process>
